"The cadence seal spoke %lld time this week. The key was right; the rhythm was not. Worth a look before it is worth a worry." = "El sello de cadencia habló %lld vez esta semana. La clave era la correcta; el ritmo, no. Vale una mirada antes de que valga una preocupación.";
"The cadence seal spoke %lld times this week. The key was right; the rhythm was not. Worth a look before it is worth a worry." = "El sello de cadencia habló %lld veces esta semana. La clave era la correcta; el ritmo, no. Vale una mirada antes de que valga una preocupación.";
